write up on the new scout rank.

17
00:01:33,200 --> 00:01:34,560
It's kind of frustrating.

18
00:01:34,560 --> 00:01:38,520
I think part of the problem is the existing paradigm that scout rank should be something

19
00:01:38,520 --> 00:01:40,120
that is achieved quickly,

20
00:01:40,120 --> 00:01:43,800
But I firmly believe it has way too much book learning in it.

21
00:01:43,800 --> 00:01:47,720
I think it should include things like a two mile hike and an hour service and real

22
00:01:47,720 --> 00:01:52,320
scouting activities to give boys a feeling for being a scout.

23
00:01:52,320 --> 00:01:56,840
Not to see if he knows Tedia's detail about how scouting is administered.

24
00:01:56,840 --> 00:02:00,480
Okay, I know I'm just ranting, but thanks for the opportunity.

25
00:02:00,480 --> 00:02:02,560
Well, Kathy, thank you for getting in touch.

26
00:02:02,560 --> 00:02:04,440
I know it's a little frustrating, isn't it?

27
00:02:04,440 --> 00:02:07,560
And the new rank requirements, which aren't really very new anymore.

28
00:02:07,560 --> 00:02:10,080
I guess everybody's been dealing with them for a while.

29
00:02:10,080 --> 00:02:14,520
Yeah, I had some comments about all of that way back when

30
00:02:14,520 --> 00:02:19,640
And some of the things for scout. yeah, they're not such a bad idea, but

31
00:02:19,640 --> 00:02:23,760
there is a lot of telling stuff rather than doing stuff.

32
00:02:23,760 --> 00:02:26,840
So, yeah, I get it.

33
00:02:26,840 --> 00:02:32,320
Hey, I want to take a moment before I go any further to thank Chris Jankowski,

34
